OL,3,AStalking law simplified to become one  
OL,4,Aoffence                                
OL,6,FA new standalone offence of stalking is
OL,7,Fto be created in England and Wales     
OL,8,Fafter a review found the law regarding 
OL,9,Fthe crime was "cluttered and confused" 
OL,10,F- but the maximum sentence will not be 
OL,11,Fincreased.                             
OL,13,FSpecific stalking offences were        
OL,14,Fintroduced in 2012 but the underlying  
OL,15,Foffence of harassment had to be        
OL,16,Festablished, and additional factors    
OL,17,Fsuch as fear or distress proven, for it
OL,18,Fto be considered stalking.             
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
