OL,3,AExpect fewer frosts and more hot days  
OL,4,Aas UK seasons shift, says Met Office   
OL,6,FThe Met Office says climate change has 
OL,7,Fled to these seasonal shifts.          
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
